{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》距離上市僅剩幾天，它將成為Rockstar開放世界犯罪動作系列迄今最具裏程碑意義的一代作品。它有望成為史上銷售速度最快、全球影響力最大的遊戲之一，並且幾乎肯定會在發售當天及之後創造和打破多項紀錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585470.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.651334+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"2e8570190cc35b8c231e5b4d962b765fbdbf9618189afa0c05909da6fcad6225","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}